= Branch5_1_2
Your machine...!
All of the humans used to want sculptures and stuff like that from me.
Then they'd put it into their machine and it would make more...!
More art! Without me...
...
But...! It would eventually run out!
You know...it would spit out the same stuff and they didn't like that...
So they'd come back to me for more...!
I would use myself to make stuff for them, pictures, sculptures...
It got harder to come up with ideas when I started to get smaller...
But I kept going and then eventually when I got too small they just...
...left.
Maybe they had enough ideas.
I know I don't anymore...
I used to be so...
...creative!
I guess nobody needs that anymore, huh?
