= Branch5_1_10
Yeah...!
I know I'm just a blob of clay now, but I used to be taller that you...!
Back when I had ideas!
Then that machine came along...
They thought they could make more of me.
That if they put enough of me in, they'd come up with something...
...great!
They just made me smaller though...
And smaller me means less ideas for them so i guess they kinda screwed that up a lot...
And me too I guess...
I've tried to lighten this place up before...like restore it and all...
I wanted a new purpose.
But there's not enough of me to go around anymore.
I couldn't even figure out where to start let alone come up with a way to redecorate...
I miss when I used to be able to do that...
Maybe if I hadn't taken this job...
I wouldn't be so useless now...
-> Branch5_1_2_2

= Branch5_1_11
No...
It was...slow...
I would come up with an idea...
Make a sculpture out of it...out of me...
Then the humans would take it.
They'd put it in their machine and it would make copies...
Or at least smush around the pieces of me and call it something new...
Things become less fun when you see that...
A machine that's...somehow better than you even though it couldn't exist without you...
And then the smaller you get, the harder it gets, but the humans keep wanting more...
It made their machine better...they would say.
I...wished they'd say that I was as good as it was some days...
So my fun didn't suddenly go away...
I don't even think my fun went away...
Just my creativity...
That's what brought the fun.
And now I'm useless.
-> Branch5_1_2_2

= Branch5_1_12
...
Thanks...?
Trust me...
I wish I wasn't so boring.
I used to be the most creative one here.
People would praise me for it all day long...!
Until they got their machine...
Then it was the most creative...
I'm not usually competitive, but...
They would just take my sculptures and give it to the machine...
It would just give them a smudged version of what I'd already made.
I could tell because there was a piece of me in every picture and sculpture I gave them.
It's how I got so small...
So if you think I'm boring, I know I am...
All of my passion left me with every chunk of myself they put into their machine.
Now I'm nothing.
Useless...
-> Branch5_1_2_2

